# Short alias for the Storylivingry Studio deck.
# 200 = rewrite, not redirect: both URLs serve the same file and neither
# bounces, so links already shared at the long path keep working unchanged.
# There is only one copy of the file, at /storylivingrystudiodeck/index.html.
/deck      /storylivingrystudiodeck/index.html   200
/deck/     /storylivingrystudiodeck/index.html   200
